start: mr
R1: 3ch=dc {2dc 4ch [4dc 4ch]x3}@ring ss@top # first group has 3 sts, the others 4
R2: 3ch=dc 3ch 3sk {4dc 4ch 4dc}@same 2ch [3sk {4dc 4ch 4dc}@same 2ch]x2 3sk {4dc 4ch 4dc}@same ss@top
R3: 3ch=dc 2ch sk dc 2ch 3sk {4dc 4ch 4dc}@same 2ch [3sk dc 2ch sk dc 2ch 3sk {4dc 4ch 4dc}@same 2ch]x3 ss@top
R4: 3ch=dc 2ch [sk dc 2ch]x2 3sk {4dc 4ch 4dc}@same 2ch 3sk dc [[2ch sk dc]x3 2ch 3sk {4dc 4ch 4dc}@same 2ch 3sk dc]x3 2ch ss@top # added 2ch in the inner repeat
